# Pipeline conventions

- Entry: `runBriefingPipeline` in `src/lib/pipeline.ts`.
- Product id in health/API: `yanxi`.
- Default: offline when no `LLM_API_KEY` or `forceOffline`.
- On LLM failure: degrade to offline; never leave the demo broken.
- Gate: hard findings block PASS; soft findings warn only.
- Do not persist user pastes (MVP has no DB).
